{"encoding":"verislop.autonomous-critique/0.1","verdict":"REPAIR","counterexamples":[],"corrections":[{"diagnostic_index":0,"artifact":"proposal.lean","explanation":"Replace the entire proof of VeriSlopAST.complete_behavior, including its sorry fallback, with `by intro x h; rfl`: unfolding solve, stats and traverse makes the equality definitionally reflexive. Replace the entire proof of VeriSlopAST.python_interface with `by exact VeriSlop.Native.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.PythonInterface` and that of VeriSlopAST.runtime with `by exact VeriSlop.Native.contract_sound VeriSlopAST.Runtime`. These existing kernel-checked lemmas discharge the native contracts without changing any frozen statements, definitions, imports, instances or registry."}]}